y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March, June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 47% of normal in January to February and 236% in April to May. Grids 16030 and 16031 both had their driest year in 2005, at 50% of normal.</p>"}
